[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11762.309, "timestamp": "03:16:02", "text": "去了打印店，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11764.79, "timestamp": "03:16:04", "text": "T恤衫店。现在我把我的标志给了他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11766.71, "timestamp": "03:16:06", "text": "可以打印出来吗？我意识到有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11769.59, "timestamp": "03:16:09", "text": "比如我的logo就存在一些问题，比如裁剪痕迹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11771.91, "timestamp": "03:16:11", "text": "还有其他一些东西。现在我意识到我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11775.19, "timestamp": "03:16:15", "text": "让切口更大，间隙更大，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11778.71, "timestamp": "03:16:18", "text": "东西。所以更容易，很容易"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11781.429, "timestamp": "03:16:21", "text": "能够理解这是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11784.55, "timestamp": "03:16:24", "text": "哦，这是个类似排队的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11786.55, "timestamp": "03:16:26", "text": "那就像是一次实验。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11789.269, "timestamp": "03:16:29", "text": "阶段。然后，呃，就像在学校里一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11791.91, "timestamp": "03:16:31", "text": "我以前会给他们我的名片之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11794.15, "timestamp": "03:16:34", "text": "我是医生，等等等等。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11796.71, "timestamp": "03:16:36", "text": "以前用来画插画的。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11799.03, "timestamp": "03:16:39", "text": "现在有个网站叫freepick.com，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11801.59, "timestamp": "03:16:41", "text": "某物。我以前常去那里拿东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11803.99, "timestamp": "03:16:43", "text": "所有这些背景资源，例如元数据"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11807.75, "timestamp": "03:16:47", "text": "金属质感的金属背景所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11809.83, "timestamp": "03:16:49", "text": "东西。这些是矢量形式的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11811.83, "timestamp": "03:16:51", "text": "正确的？所以它会有很多层。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11814.229, "timestamp": "03:16:54", "text": "那里。所以我以前的做法是把所有东西都弄到手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11816.15, "timestamp": "03:16:56", "text": "随意挑选一些东西，然后尝试制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11818.309, "timestamp": "03:16:58", "text": "把所有东西都放进 Adob​​e 里了。"}]